NOTE ON SCOPE
=============
This license applies ONLY to the framework code shipped under this repository
(generic Python, schemas, templates, documentation, tests, example
workflows, and example project scaffolds).

It does NOT grant rights over:
  * Real story scripts, character descriptions, or reference images
    contributed to any project created from this framework. Those remain
    the property of their respective owners.
  * The ComfyUI workflow JSON a user wires into a project's ``private/``
    directory. Users retain full ownership of their workflows.
  * The generated video, audio, and subtitle files under each project's
    ``output/`` directory.

When in doubt, treat the framework as a tool and your project's content
as your own.